WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
If you have to do a site safety inspection, with Quickler you can

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.320
walk the site and send photos and voice notes on WhatsApp as you go round.

3
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.280
When you need to send your location, Quickler can add the address

4
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.780
and the weather for you.

5
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.920
The faults that you pick up as you go round the site will be added

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.580
to the To do list on Quickler.

7
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.180
When a site manager receives the report from you, they'll be able to

8
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.420
copy the actions straight into their own system.

9
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:29.200
Every inspection is kept with the whole chat and every photo, in

10
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.780
case anyone ever asks what was done on the day.
